{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act45side_level_act45side_07_beg",
  "groupId": "act45side",
  "stageId": "act45side_07",
  "title": "永恒绚烂的藏品",
  "storyCode": "SS-7",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "580e8bf7d5b5775f5755371dad1b18c4b55c124142ab7f79b658b59b16c78f52",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "65_g6_sakikopianoroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥子的琴弹得越来越好了啊~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有、有吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥子的变化，我当然清楚，我可是你的妈妈呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能听出来，祥子一直都很努力，即使在外辛苦工作，对于钢琴的练习也从未松懈过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感觉祥子在外面经历了很多呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然很不想打扰你们练琴，但饭已经做好咯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "65_g5_sakikodininghall"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔——好吃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1940_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么样，我手艺又长进了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是不知道......他逼我尝了多少次，才有了现在这个味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1940_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这盘沙拉，快试试怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，很好吃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1940_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为了祥子能喜欢，我做了很多细微的调整哦！还不赖吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1940_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有很多别的祥子喜欢的菜哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "65_g5_sakikodininghall"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥子？祥子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1940_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎、怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知不觉，吃得有点多......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "31_g3_mini12_farmland"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在好点了吗......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是的，你爸爸就是这样的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过这就是他的行事风格，大多数时候也挺可爱的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥子，你会原谅他的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他真的很爱你哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我真的很爱你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妈妈，怎么突然这么说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你出远门的这段时间，我开始越来越频繁地翻相册了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从你出生时的照片，翻到一岁、两岁、三岁......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在父母的眼中，孩子永远是最重要、最特殊的存在哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你刚出生的时候，手掌只有我的一半不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但现在你看，已经比我的要大一点点啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "母亲拉起祥子的手，将两人的掌心慢慢对齐。\n不知为何，祥子用五指紧紧地扣住了妈妈的手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妈妈，你的手好暖和......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我在哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "妈妈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哭鼻子也没关系哦。你以前哭鼻子的时候，我也是这么安慰你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸......我以前有那么爱哭鼻子吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在你很小很小的时候吧，那时祥子经常为了一颗糖又哭又闹呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然祥子现在是个坚强的孩子，但那时真的是个爱哭包呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是、是吗，我一点都不记得了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈，妈妈可不会骗你哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那......妈妈，你还记得我的高中入学典礼吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然啦。我还记得那天你穿着校服，我们一家还在校门前合影呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像是呢......真让人怀念啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们以前，还经历过哪些事？妈妈......我想听你讲，关于我们的回忆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥子，你是不是离开家里太久啦？怎么今天这么黏人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "家......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......既然你想听，那我就再回忆回忆吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从什么时候开始讲起呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从我出生的时候开始吧，我想一直听下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1941_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，那就从你的出生开始讲起吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "就这样，在田间小路上，母女二人肩并着肩，以不快不慢的速度走着，仿佛可以一直这样走下去。\n就像她们最开始的那段美好时光一样，不慌不忙，没有戛然而止。\n她们的手，就像最开始连接两人的那根脐带。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥子——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红豆",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你找到回家的路了呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱丽丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "红豆小姐，这台车好像有故障，快放我下来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红豆",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看看......怎、怎么和在罗德岛上学的操作方法不一样啊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "红豆",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行不行，要停不下来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱丽丝",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要撞上了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "贝娜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥子，你们快闪开——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
